#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""sdd — helper for spec-driven work folders. Python 3.9+, standard library only.

The folder contract is described in docs/specs/README.md. Run `sdd -h` for commands.
Only the orchestrator (the session running /roman:run) should run the commands that
write: set, log, verify, merge, push.
"""
